<</Dest[121 0 R/XYZ 72.107422 377.19238 0]/Next 1367 0 R/Parent 1355 0 R/Prev 1365 0 R/SE 450 0 R/Title(Figure 5. Individual bee behaviors or traits in relation to the environment the bees were tested in \(across all 9 trials\). Search time was longer in the complex environment; other traits were not affected by environment \(Mann-Whitney-U-Tests, for the 6\
 traits p = 0.055, 0.02, 0.09, 0.10, 0.66, 0.84\). The y-axis shows the relative trait score = \(actual score - mean for that trait\)/\(standard deviation of scores for that trait\).  )>>
endobj
